  "description": "BMECat.net is an open source .NET library for reading and writing BMEcat product catalogs. It reads BMEcat 1.2 and 2005 (including 2005fd and the many non-conformant files found in practice) into a version independent object model with products, prices, order details, features, MIME infos, references, logistics data, parties and catalog structures. Catalogs are written as BMEcat 2005 documents that conform to the official schema. Supports .NET Standard 2.0, .NET 8 and .NET 10.",
  "id": "BMECat.net",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-28T06:23:00.023Z",
