  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/stephanstapel/BMECat.net",
  "published": "2026-10-28T06:20:21.62Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "4.6.0:\n- Writer: buyer and supplier as parties incl. contact details, product features and classification, MIME infos, catalog structure with product to group mappings, product references and logistics details\n- Writer: documents conform to the BMEcat 2005 schema, uses the BMEcat 2005 namespace instead of 2005fd, STOCK and the deprecated EAN element are no longer written (the EAN is written as INTERNATIONAL_PID)\n- Reader: fixes for parties, product order, encodings, German dates and the catalog name of BMEcat 2005 documents\n- Reading and writing of numbers and dates independent from the machine culture\n- Non-seekable streams are rejected with IllegalStreamException, temporary files are always cleaned up\n- New target frameworks: netstandard2.0, net8.0 and net10.0",
